"SSH Agent" = "SSH 代理";
"Enable SSH Agent" = "启用 SSH 代理";
"Ask for authorization when using SSH Agent" = "使用 SSH 代理时提示授权";
"Always" = "每次都询问";
"Never" = "从不询问";
"Remember Until the Vault Locks" = "记住直到保险库被锁定";
"While the vault is unlocked, processes running as your user can request signatures without confirmation." = "保险库解锁时，以当前用户身份运行的进程可以请求签名，无需确认。";
"Approval applies to the same local process and key until the vault locks." = "仅对同一个本地进程和密钥记住授权，直到保险库被锁定。";
"OpenVault uses a separate local socket and does not change your existing SSH agent." = "OpenVault 使用独立的本地套接字，不会更改现有的 SSH 代理。";
"Unlock OpenVault, then retry your SSH command." = "解锁 OpenVault 后，再运行 SSH 命令。";
"Copy Socket Path" = "复制套接字路径";
"Local Socket" = "本地套接字";
"Use the copied path as the IdentityAgent in your SSH configuration. Do not forward this agent." = "在 SSH 配置中将 IdentityAgent 指向复制的路径。请勿转发此代理。";
"The OpenVault socket path is occupied. Close other OpenVault instances before retrying." = "OpenVault 的套接字路径已被占用。请关闭其他 OpenVault 实例后重试。";
"This Mac’s home path is too long for the OpenSSH socket." = "本机的用户主目录路径过长，无法创建 OpenSSH 可用的套接字。";
"OpenVault could not start the local SSH Agent on this Mac." = "OpenVault 无法在这台 Mac 上启动本地 SSH 代理。";
"Retry SSH Agent" = "重试启动 SSH 代理";
"OpenVault SSH Request" = "OpenVault SSH 请求";
"Authorize an SSH signature?" = "授权本次 SSH 签名？";
"Vault Item" = "保险库条目";
"Unknown local process" = "未知的本地进程";
"Local Caller" = "本地调用方";
"Allow only if you started this request. OpenVault cannot verify the remote destination." = "只有在你发起此请求时才应授权。OpenVault 无法验证远程目标。";
"Deny" = "拒绝";
"Authorize" = "授权";
